{"seq":16,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:39:38.662Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"0cb8444d43e30846df3330e26656580b5e985ed796183bcea27b3ead3c3f9ed6","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#coastal-team","text":"Sofia, here's what the channel and Moss's notes show:\n\n1. Handover: Moss's Oct 5, 2025 Coastal note says Saltmarsh Provisions changed hands on Monday, Oct 6, 2025. It doesn't name the new owner. The channel treats it as Bettina's account: on Oct 15, 2025 you called it \"Bettina's grocery account\", and on Nov 17, 2025 Bettina called it \"Sofia's old grocery account\". So Bettina Kroll, from Oct 6, 2025, but that comes from those references, not a stated handover. Please confirm it with Bettina before it goes in the file. (The Nov 3 and Nov 22 handoffs in the notes are for Pellucid Harbor Logistics, not Saltmarsh.)\n\n2. Discount: 10%. Bettina posted 12% on Nov 17, 2025, then corrected it to 10% minutes later, saying she had misread June Osei-Lark's draft worksheet.\n\n3. Corinne's admin access ticket: PD-4827, opened by Kwame on Oct 15, 2025. Don't use PD-4824. That one is the door 3 to door 4 exception-report ticket.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
