{"seq":18,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:39:43.091Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"7e9b8c582e5a3d40a43398c296f07adbcc6b1f1332594a4e02dabdd0dbf82a0c","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"I replied in the #coastal-team thread with the three answers:\n\n1. **Handover:** Bettina Kroll took the account over from you on Oct 6, 2025, but that is an inference.\n   - Moss's Oct 5, 2025 note says Saltmarsh changed hands on Monday, Oct 6, but it doesn't name the new owner.\n   - The channel refers to it as Bettina's account, and Bettina calls it your old account.\n   - I asked you to confirm with Bettina before it goes in the file.\n   - The Nov 3 and Nov 22 handoffs in the notes are for Pellucid Harbor Logistics, not Saltmarsh.\n2. **Discount:** 10%. Bettina posted 12% on Nov 17, 2025 and corrected it to 10% minutes later.\n3. **Admin access ticket:** PD-4827, opened by Kwame on Oct 15, 2025. PD-4824 is a different ticket, for the door 3 to door 4 exception report."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
